[size=6][b]💰 Haul[/b][/size]

[b]If you farm it, Haul has the numbers.[/b]

Haul is a farming session tracker that captures [i]everything[/i]: every loot drop, every coin, experience, reputation, currencies, kills, and gathering. It values the lot and rolls it into a clean movable bar that tells you what this farm actually earns per hour.

[size=5][b]The Custom Header Bar[/b][/size]

A compact, movable readout you design yourself with template fields. Session time, haul value, gross, gold per hour, cash, arranged however you like. Glance at it mid-pull, or leave it running all night.

[size=5][b]Sessions that know when to stop counting[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Pause actually pauses.[/b] Anything you pick up while paused (a mailbox run, a vendor detour) is captured in the log but stays out of the session's totals and gold per hour. Your farm rate stays honest.
[*][b]Instances, set aside and picked back up.[/b] Turn on "New session on instances" and zoning into a dungeon parks your open-world session untouched while the instance tracks on its own. Leave, and the old one picks up exactly where it was.
[*][b]Keep, merge, combine.[/b] Every run banks to your history when you start a new one. Fold tonight's run into last night's and build a real record of what each farm is worth.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Real values, your price source[/b][/size]

Item values come from vendor prices or your auction data, with TSM and Auctionator supported. Per item, visible, priced. Exclude anything you don't count as income with a click. Gray quality and bound items value at vendor automatically. Mail gold is tracked as its own category, and returned auction items are never counted as new income, so a listing that came back doesn't read as profit.

[size=5][b]Beyond loot[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Experience.[/b] XP per session and per hour, attributed to kills, quests, gathering, and discovery.
[*][b]Reputation and currencies.[/b] Every faction tick and currency gain, per session.
[*][b]Kills and gathering.[/b] What you killed, what it dropped, which nodes you hit.
[*][b]The Data page.[/b] Browse every saved session in detail: items, sources, timings, the works.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Optional: your farm history, everywhere[/b][/size]

Pair with [b]GEC Uplink[/b], our free desktop companion, and your sessions sync to your profile at [url=https://goblineng.co]goblineng.co[/url]. Gold totals, best sessions, and per-hour rates, browsable outside the game. Entirely optional. Haul is fully functional standalone.

